  "inCredits": {
    "extract": "5 credits for most pages: the page's own price plus 4 credits. A call that finds none of the fields is free",
    "browserTask": "3 credits for each step the task takes, up to maxSteps and maxCost. A task that ends before its first step costs nothing. Starting a task sets aside the most it can cost, and what it does not use comes back when it ends",
    "signUp": "Free, and needs no key. Returns a claimUrl for your person and a secret code. Your person signs in with GitHub or Google and approves. A new account starts with 5,000 free credits. Then send the code to POST /v1/signup/poll to collect the key. Each IP address can sign up a few times a day, then the answer is rateLimited with retryAfterSeconds.",
    "getUsage": "Free. Your balance in credits is `balanceCredits` on [Limits](/api-reference/endpoint/limits). `balanceMicros` stays for older clients."
  }
